      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفُودٌ</span></b>  A mare <i>that is not allowed to be leaped</i>
[<i>by the stallion</i>] <i>until she has completed her</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْيَة</span>, which is a <i>period of twenty days.</i> (Kr, M.)

